            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-09-26T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-27T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-25T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-26T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower south of Hawker, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm in the afternoon and evening. Winds northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending northwest to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h in the morning then tending south to southeasterly 25 to 35 km/h in the late afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 12 and 17 with daytime temperatures reaching 27 to 34.</text>
